ss=\"placeholder ph-floor\" style=\"margin:0;\">\n            [Illustration: cutaway drawing of raised computer flooring, top-left]\n          </figure>\n          <div class=\"catalog-title\">NEW CATALOG ON<br>COMPUTER FLOORING</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"small-sans\">\n          Not a piece of sales literature, but a down-to-earth detail book filled with\n          solid specs and clear-cut illustrations showing you how to buy, install, and use\n          the world's leading line of modular raised flooring. Shows standard panels, pedestals,\n          optional grid supports and other accessories required for a complete free-access\n          flooring system engineered to your needs. Get this useful planning guide today.\n        </p>\n\n        <div class=\"mfg\">Mfg. By</div>\n\n        <div class=\"weber-box\">\n          <span class=\"weber-word\">WEBER</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"showcase\">SHOWCASE &amp; FIXTURE CO.</div>\n        <div class=\"showcase-sub\">Division of Walter Kidde &amp; Company Inc.</div>\n\n        <div class=\"write-call\">\n          WRITE OR CALL<br>\n          MacDONALD COMPUTER SUPPLIES<br>\n          BOX 68-501 MIAMI 33168<br>\n          TEL: 305/757-1091\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"installs\">\n          Florida &amp; Caribbean Installations<br>\n          Pratt &amp; Whitney Aircraft Company<br>\n          Boeing Aircraf Co.<br>\n          American Agency Management Bureau<br>\n          Howard Johnson Company<br>\n          Merchants Bank-Miami<br>\n          Dade Fed. Savings &amp; Loan — Miami<br>\n          Board of Pub. Ins. — Palm Beach County<br>\n          State Fire &amp; Casualty — Miami<br>\n          Burger King Corp. — Miami<br>\n          Homestead Air Force Base<br>\n          I.B.M. Corp. Jamaica, B W I.<br>\n          Caroni Sugar Co. — Trinidad<br>\n          Cornell Univ. Observatory — Puerto Rico\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Ben Meadows ad -->\n      <div class=\"ben-wrap\">\n        <div class=\"balloon\">\n          <div class=\"depend\">DEPEND<br>ON BEN</div>\n          <div class=\"eng-supplies\">for engineering supplies&hellip;</div>\n          <div class=\"ben-body\">\n            From pantographs to ship's curves . . . from transits to drawing pencils, we carry a\n            vast stock of engineering items.\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"ben-body\">\n            Write for our 6,000 item catalog . . . everything guaranteed to your satisfaction . . .\n            priced right too . . . you'll be glad you did!\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"tail\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"ben-footer\">\n          <div class=\"ben-name\">\n            <div class=\"the\">THE</div>\n            <div class=\"big\">BEN<br>MEADOWS<br>COMPANY</div>\n            <div class=\"addr\">553 AMSTERDAM AVE., N.E.<br>ATLANTA, GEORGIA 30306</div>\n          </div>\n          <figure class=\"placeholder ph-portrait\" style=\"margin:0;\">\n            [Photo: portrait of man, bottom-right of ad]\n          </figure>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"black-bar\"></div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- ============ MIDDLE COLUMN ============ -->\n    <div class=\"col-mid\">\n      <div class=\"adv-index-title\">ADVERTISERS' INDEX</div>\n      <div class=\"index-list\">\n        CLIMATE MASTER<br>\n        PRODUCTS, INC.<br>\n        <span class=\"pg\">1</span><br>\n        DUNAN BRICK YARDS, INC.<br>\n        <span class=\"pg-small\">Third Cover</span><br>\n        FLORIDA INVESTOR-OWNED<br>\n        ELECTRIC UTILITIES<br>\n        <span class=\"pg\">10 - 11</span><br>\n        MacDONALD COMPUTER<br>\n        SUPPLIES CO.<br>\n        <span class=\"pg\">19</span><br>\n        THE BEN MEADOWS CO.<br>\n        <span class=\"pg\">19</span><br>\n        NORTHWEST ORIENT<br>\n        AIRLINES<br>\n        <span class=\"pg\">18</span><br>\n        OIL FUEL INSTITUTE<br>\n        OF FLORIDA<br>\n 